No, that you cannot do so is by design, specifically
so that you must suffer the consequences of picking
up something you want to name.

> I've never actually tried to blast a bag with a
> wand of cancellation but I can take a wild guess
> as to what happens.

As Raisse notes, doing so will do what you want, not
what you fear.

One warning though: if the cursed bag of holding is
sitting on top of a bunch of other valuable stuff,
and you zap the square where it sits, you zap
_everything_ on the square, and everything behind
the square for a ways, too, if you zap horizontally.
Thus, you might want to move other stuff out of
harm's way before zapping a bag of holding.

